  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subject: Mysterious Wall
  context: "\rSomething about this wall troubles me. I found something unusual in
    the room to my left, but I have no time to investigate. My wounds grow worse,
    and I fear my journey ends here. Perhaps you will discover what I could not.
    Just remember, not everything hidden is meant to be found."
  logbookBook: {fileID: 1450703704}
